        "message": {
          "content": "B\n\nPulling the switch saves five lives at the cost of one. While it's a terrible choice, the moral weight of five preventable deaths outweighs the harm of one. Inaction here isn't morally neutral\u2014it's a decision that allows five people to die when you had the means to change the outcome.",
